Description: chess database application
 Chesswiz is a chess database application based on Scidb (by Gregor
 Cramer), itself inspired by Scid. This build
 includes the Stockfish, Reckless and Sjeng engines and the AI assistant.
 .
 Built on the machine that builds the package, for its own CPU.
